  "NROOT" [label="(0,0,0) The study proposes to develop and evaluate controlled extracellular electrical stimulation of CD8+ T cells during ex vivo expansion as a way to enhance TCR signaling and EGR1-mediated chromatin-accessibility programs, promote optimized effector-cell differentiation, and improve antitumor efficacy in adoptive cell therapy and CAR-T therapy.", fillcolor="lightyellow", style="filled"];
